asr-000272
00:15:54.020 --> 00:16:03.480
John Castillo: Okay, at this juncture, I think we now move to what I believe will be one of the most important highlights of today's program.

asr-000273
00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:14.940
John Castillo: We will hear directly from our CSO partners on their perspectives, concerns, and recommendations regarding the 2027 National Budget.

asr-000274
00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:25.280
John Castillo: But before we begin, just a few reminders to help us manage our time and give everyone an opportunity to be heard.

asr-000275
00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:42.640
John Castillo: To ensure that we can accommodate all our CSO representatives within the available time, each speaker will be given approximately two to three minutes to share or less, to share their key statements and recommendation on the 2027 National Budget.

asr-000276
00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.880
John Castillo: Don't worry, don't worry.

asr-000277
00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:49.500
John Castillo: You will hear a signal or receive a notice when your time is nearly up.

asr-000278
00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:57.420
John Castillo: So we encourage everyone to focus on your most important concerns, recommendations, or key messages.

asr-000279
00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:12.420
John Castillo: If there are additional concerns or recommendations that you are not able to cover within your allotted time, we encourage you to submit your position papers or other written submission to the Task Force on People's Participation.

asr-000280
00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.840
John Castillo: This will be considered.

asr-000281
00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:22.660
John Castillo: This will be considered as part of the continuing discussion and where appropriate will be referred for feedback, similar to what Kong Abet presented earlier.

asr-000282
00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:26.700
John Castillo: And we will also want to highlight that there are two distinct parts po.

asr-000283
00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:35.260
John Castillo: First part, each CSO will talk about their comments, concerns on the 2027 National Budget, substantive.

asr-000284
00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:47.980
John Castillo: And then, after po makapag-deliver na ng three-minute speech or statement from each CSO, our panelists will be given the chance to speak, share their inputs or observation.

asr-000285
00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:59.620
John Castillo: And then there will be second part on the discussion about the procedural matters on how to improve or strengthen the people's participation on the budget process.

asr-000286
00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.460
John Castillo: So, okay po tayo doon?

asr-000287
00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:04.370
John Castillo: Okay.

asr-000288
00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.870
John Castillo: So, we will handle this.

asr-000289
00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:35.990
John Castillo: Since all of our vice chairs and senior vice chair are already present here, and some of our CSO partners have already signified their intent to raise their concerns on certain matters, we will begin with, letter A po ba muna tayo, agriculture matters, to serve as, to hear from the Philippine Association of Agriculture.

asr-000290
00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:36.670
John Castillo: Agriculture.

asr-000291
00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:37.370
John Castillo: Agriculturist.

asr-000292
00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:38.370
John Castillo: Tama po ba, sir?

asr-000293
00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:49.030
John Castillo: The president or the vice president of Philippine Association of Agriculture is incorporated, Al, Mr. Al Christian Hilario.

asr-000294
00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:52.490
Al Christian R. Hilario: Marami salamat po, and good morning po sa lahat.

asr-000295
00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:59.590
Al Christian R. Hilario: Kami po sa Philippine Association of Agriculture is ay nandito para po mag-observe.

asr-000296
00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:09.860
Al Christian R. Hilario: Kami po sa Philippine Association of Agriculture is ay nandito po para tumulong na ma-prioritize po ang agricultural sector.

asr-000297
00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.860
Al Christian R. Hilario: Sa 2027 budget.

asr-000298
00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:25.640
Al Christian R. Hilario: Kasabay din po nito, kasabay po ng enactment o pagsasabatas ng Philippine Agriculturalist Act or the Republic Act 12215, yung pagpapalakas po ng mga agrikulturist na matagal ng napabayaan.

asr-000299
00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:31.320
Al Christian R. Hilario: And isa po sa mga concern nito ay yung adjustment ng salaries na hindi na-implement.

asr-000300
00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:38.300
Al Christian R. Hilario: Since one year na po na yung batas ay naipapasa, yung upgrading po from SG-11 ng mga nasa government, agrikulturist,

asr-000301
00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.080
Al Christian R. Hilario: ay hindi pa na-i-adjust into SG-11.

asr-000303
00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:44.640
Al Christian R. Hilario: At tinatanong namin yung mga agencies ay wala po silang definite response.

asr-000304
00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:50.440
Al Christian R. Hilario: Sa private sector naman po, yung mga practicing agrikulturist natin, hindi na i-a-align.

asr-000305
00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:55.640
Al Christian R. Hilario: Still lowest, mababa pa rin po, kumpado sa industrial rate, yung kanilang mga salaries.

asr-000306
00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.720
Al Christian R. Hilario: So yun po yung isang tinitignan natin sa budget.

asr-000307
00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:06.800
Al Christian R. Hilario: And kasabay din po nito, yung iba't-ibang mga agro-environmental investment programs ay atin po tinitignan.

asr-000308
00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.840
Al Christian R. Hilario: And other projects na magpapalakas.

asr-000309
00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.120
Al Christian R. Hilario: Sa ngayon po, sa dami.

asr-000310
00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:14.040
Al Christian R. Hilario: Sa dami ng mga calamities at sa mga pinominan na na-i-encounter natin across the country.

asr-000311
00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:23.620
Al Christian R. Hilario: Isa rin po sa tinitignan ng grupo ng agrikulturist ay ma-ensure po na yung food security plan ay naka-align po at well-funded.

asr-000312
00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:32.160
Al Christian R. Hilario: Para po maiwasan yung ating, kung hindi po maiwasan, totally malimited or to zero yung ating malnutrition and gutom.

asr-000313
00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:33.520
Al Christian R. Hilario: Yun lang po at maraming salamat.

asr-000314
00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:36.120
John Castillo: Thank you very much, President or Sir.

asr-000315
00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:09.970
Tim Salomon: I don't believe na ginawang individual.

asr-000316
00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.150
Tim Salomon: Yun yung tatapusin niya.

asr-000317
00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:18.110
Tim Salomon: [unclear] million hectares, they target 750,000 hectares next year.

asr-000318
00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:22.890
Tim Salomon: Okay lang, well and good, kailangan ng taong bahay, kailangan ng magsasakang individual titles.

asr-000319
00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:29.010
Tim Salomon: What we asked was, ano yung target doon sa land acquisition and distribution?

asr-000320
00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.790
Tim Salomon: And they said 20,000 hectares only.

asr-000321
00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:39.850
Tim Salomon: Tapos, ang sinasabi nila, on that issue, bakit hindi po tapusin yung land acquisition and distribution?

asr-000322
00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:48.670
Tim Salomon: Just as a context, ang last notices of coverage issued were on 2014 pa, June 2014.

asr-000323
00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:55.050
Tim Salomon: So, at least, lahat ng mga [unclear] agrarian reform have been waiting at least 12 years.

asr-000324
00:22:55.410 --> 00:22:56.770
Tim Salomon: Kasi 2026 na, diba?

asr-000325
00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:06.270
Tim Salomon: And that means to say, dapat 2015 tapos na yun kasi yun yung policy nandar, one year land distribution lang.

asr-000326
00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:09.170
Tim Salomon: Tapos ngayon ang target nila 20,000 lang.

asr-000327
00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:15.690
Tim Salomon: Yun po yung tinanong na hindi po satisfactorily sinagot ni Secretary Estrella, bakit 20,000 lang?

asr-000328
00:23:16.110 --> 00:23:22.850
Tim Salomon: Kahit meron pang about 580,000 hectares na balance doon sa land acquisition and distribution.

asr-000329
00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:26.790
Tim Salomon: Ang tanong namin, bakit di tanatapos?

asr-000330
00:23:27.250 --> 00:23:30.170
Tim Salomon: Sino yung nakikinabang sa hindi pagtapos ang land distribution?

asr-000331
00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:34.810
Tim Salomon: Kasi alam naman natin, yung mga huling natitira are yung mga landed elites.

asr-000332
00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:39.510
Tim Salomon: And we want sa ANAD 2 to see the sincerity of Congress din.

asr-000333
00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:44.550
Tim Salomon: Understand, many of the members of Congress are also subject to agrarian reform.

asr-000334
00:23:45.210 --> 00:23:49.290
Tim Salomon: Kasi may mga land holdings po tayong nasa atin pa, hindi pa napapa sa ilalim.

asr-000335
00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.450
Tim Salomon: So, nag-compute po kami ng numbers kung ano yung kailangan.

asr-000336
00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.750
Tim Salomon: Ang hinihingi lang ng DAR ay 100 million.

asr-000337
00:23:54.930 --> 00:23:59.350
Tim Salomon: That is only enough for 2,000 hectares purchase land acquisition.

asr-000338
00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:03.950
Tim Salomon: Paano nila magagawa yung mandate nila kung hindi nila hinihingi yung pera?

asr-000339
00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:08.290
Tim Salomon: Perhaps hot air lang yung sinabi ni Presidente sa SONA.

asr-000340
00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:09.210
Tim Salomon: Natatapusin niya.

asr-000341
00:24:09.210 --> 00:24:20.950
Tim Salomon: Second, meron po kasi kaming tinatanong din doon regarding dun sa pagtatanggal sa listahan ng lupa dun sa DAR.

asr-000342
00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:23.210
Tim Salomon: Sinabi nila, they remove problematic land holdings.

asr-000343
00:24:24.270 --> 00:24:27.210
Tim Salomon: So, we ask, isn't it illegal to remove land holdings?

asr-000344
00:24:28.310 --> 00:24:34.890
Tim Salomon: Kasi one hectare removed from the list is one farmer left landless for another year at least.

asr-000345
00:24:35.050 --> 00:24:36.530
Tim Salomon: Kasi hindi siya napunta dun sa budget.

asr-000346
00:24:36.530 --> 00:24:38.530
Tim Salomon: So, we wanted to ask, legal ba yung pagpapakita?

asr-000347
00:24:39.210 --> 00:24:39.910
Tim Salomon: Ano yung proseso nila?

asr-000348
00:24:40.030 --> 00:24:41.170
Tim Salomon: At ano yung proseso nila?

asr-000349
00:24:41.630 --> 00:24:45.370
Tim Salomon: Ano yung validation to get due process dun sa magsasaka natatanggal sa listahan?

asr-000350
00:24:45.490 --> 00:24:45.990
Tim Salomon: Maraming salamat.

asr-000351
00:24:46.050 --> 00:24:47.530
John Castillo: Thank you very much, Sir Tim.

asr-000352
00:24:47.930 --> 00:24:58.590
John Castillo: Any of the, are there other CSO who wish to signify their concerns with respect to agriculture matters?

asr-000353
