John Castillo: If any from our Vice Chair or Senior Vice Chair or any panelists who would want to respond or share their observations,

asr-000355
00:25:11.100 --> 00:25:12.460
John Castillo: or insights.

asr-000356
00:25:12.660 --> 00:25:18.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much, Mr. Chair or Mr. Senior Vice Chair.

asr-000357
00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:26.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you also to the CSOs and various organizations that have taken time out to join us today.

asr-000358
00:25:26.980 --> 00:25:31.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And thank you also sa napaka-interesting na mga tanong po na hinaharap.

asr-000359
00:25:31.960 --> 00:25:35.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, before I address the questions that were asked,

asr-000360
00:25:35.480 --> 00:25:40.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I would just like to mention that for the year 2026,

asr-000361
00:25:41.100 --> 00:25:47.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: it has been the best year for agriculture ever in the history po of the Philippines.

asr-000362
00:25:48.700 --> 00:25:51.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, siguro po, let's take a moment to appreciate that statement.

asr-000363
00:25:52.860 --> 00:25:55.520
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And recognize po, lahat po nang tumulong.

asr-000364
00:25:55.940 --> 00:26:00.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Of course, I would like to acknowledge Secretary Tiu Laurel.

asr-000365
00:26:00.320 --> 00:26:03.520
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But behind him are so many people po.

asr-000366
00:26:03.520 --> 00:26:09.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: From the top down talaga po hanggat sa bawat magsasaka po ng Pilipinas,

asr-000367
00:26:09.940 --> 00:26:11.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: ay tumulong

asr-000368
00:26:11.100 --> 00:26:15.180
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: po rito sa nangyari pong napakagandang balita na ito.

asr-000369
00:26:15.540 --> 00:26:22.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And yes, we acknowledge po iyong contribution po na mga agriculturists din po dito.

asr-000370
00:26:22.760 --> 00:26:27.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And yes, I truly agree that you should be paid po the proper salary grade.

asr-000371
00:26:27.680 --> 00:26:31.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, to mention po, ano po bang ginawa ng DA that is so amazing this year?

asr-000372
00:26:32.540 --> 00:26:36.520
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Agriculture and fisheries posted the strongest growth in eight years.

asr-000373
00:26:37.220 --> 00:26:39.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, this is the fastest po.

asr-000374
00:26:39.560 --> 00:26:40.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It grew 2.6%.

asr-000375
00:26:41.100 --> 00:26:47.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And our second quarter harvest is really the largest po.

