Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: At ito pong lahat ng ito ay amin pong dadalhin sa committee para po aming upuan at nalagyan po namin ng tamang sagot ang inyong katanungan.

asr-002173
01:33:22.980 --> 01:33:23.560
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Salamat po ulit.

asr-002174
01:33:24.260 --> 01:33:26.420
John Castillo: Thank you very much, Vice Chair Reynan.

asr-002175
01:33:27.580 --> 01:33:30.980
John Castillo: Any other feedbacks from our panelists, SVC?

asr-002176
01:33:31.520 --> 01:33:38.740
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yes, maraming salamat, Vice Chair Reynan, for your answers to address some of the concerns.

asr-002177
01:33:38.740 --> 01:33:43.740
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: I would like to commend Miss Fajardo.

asr-002178
01:33:45.140 --> 01:34:09.860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Isabel, for your comments and suggestions talagang with this engagement and all the other NGOs ang dami namin natututunan that these informations we can really use to amend or modify some of the budget of the departments to address the concerns.

asr-002179
01:34:09.860 --> 01:34:14.340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So perspective matters and you're giving us new perspective.

asr-002180
01:34:15.140 --> 01:34:19.240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: That we can use in order to improve our budgets further.

asr-002181
01:34:19.900 --> 01:34:26.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kanina habang nakikinig kay Miss Fajardo, parang dinidescribe nyo na po yung meritocracy.

asr-002182
01:34:26.800 --> 01:34:45.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kasi from spending or process-based budgeting, kung saan ginegrade ngayon for efficiency of spending or not spending, yung meritocracy, same as what you said, kailangan outcome-based din.

asr-002183
01:34:45.140 --> 01:34:49.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So dahil mas makikita natin yung impact.

asr-002184
01:34:49.620 --> 01:35:02.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So unlike now na talagang is everything above board, sumunod ba sa process, but aside from that, did it make an impact dun sa buhay ng ating mga mamamayan?

asr-002185
01:35:02.540 --> 01:35:11.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And that is the essence of the meritocracy bill na hindi lang process-based but also outcome-based.

asr-002186
01:35:11.320 --> 01:35:12.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So.

asr-002187
01:35:13.260 --> 01:35:14.420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So.

asr-002188
01:35:15.140 --> 01:35:18.000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: You hit the nail right on the head.

asr-002189
01:35:18.760 --> 01:35:24.160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And since mobility yung pinag-uusapan natin, ito yung isang advocacy po ng inyong lingkod.

asr-002190
01:35:24.160 --> 01:35:27.300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And hardly anyone is talking about it.

asr-002191
01:35:27.960 --> 01:35:44.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Is that, do we know that we're losing 3.5 billion pesos a day because of the inefficiencies ng ating infrastructure, ng ating ekonomiya?

asr-002192
01:35:44.020 --> 01:35:45.120
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tanghali na po.

asr-002193
01:35:45.140 --> 01:35:52.600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ngayon, mamaya hapo na, and we lost 3.5 billion pesos a day, another 3.5 billion pesos.

asr-002194
01:35:53.360 --> 01:36:06.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And if you compute that in one year, yan na po yung capital outlay ng ating current budget, amounting to 1.2, 1.3 trillion pesos.

asr-002195
01:36:06.380 --> 01:36:14.500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So yan na halos yung pinagdibatihan ngayon sa House and eventually with the Senate, sa BICAM.

asr-002196
01:36:15.140 --> 01:36:34.720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Na 1.2 to 1.3 trillion na katulad nung sinabi, ito na lang yung leeway natin dahil yung iba, naka-earmark na po or pang sweldo na or MOE na hindi na natin masyadong pwedeng mamodify.

asr-002197
01:36:34.720 --> 01:36:34.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Okay.

asr-002198
01:36:35.440 --> 01:36:35.580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So.

asr-002199
01:36:37.160 --> 01:36:39.540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Na ano lang po siya.

asr-002200
01:36:39.760 --> 01:36:40.120
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kumbaga.

asr-002201
01:36:41.840 --> 01:36:44.960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Na offset lang po siya nitong losses.

asr-002202
01:36:44.960 --> 01:36:46.860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 3.5 billion pesos a day.

asr-002203
01:36:47.760 --> 01:36:54.280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And kinumpute ko po ito from when the study started, JICA study po ito.

asr-002204
01:36:54.780 --> 01:36:58.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Simula 2014, 2.5 billion pesos a day pa lang.

asr-002205
01:36:58.860 --> 01:37:01.860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: In update ng 2017, 3.5 na.

asr-002206
01:37:02.480 --> 01:37:12.600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And according to the same study, kung hindi ma-solusyonan, by 2030, aakyat ng 5.4 billion pesos a day.

asr-002207
01:37:13.080 --> 01:37:14.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, anlaki po nun.

asr-002208
01:37:14.620 --> 01:37:24.860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And to date, kinumpute ko po, kung accurate yung study, we've lost 13.7 trillion pesos already.

asr-002209
01:37:25.760 --> 01:37:27.180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Twice the current budget.

asr-002210
01:37:28.360 --> 01:37:43.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, ito po, kung nagtataka po yung ating mga kasama, ito po because of the inefficiencies ng congestion, time wasted, pollution, work-life balance compromised, productivity loss, opportunity loss, and so on and so forth.

asr-002211
01:37:43.800 --> 01:38:03.240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, napakalaking problema po nito, ito yung sinasabi ko na hinahabol natin yung mga allegedly corrupt, yun yung sins of commission, pero hindi natin napapansin yung sins of omission.

asr-002212
01:38:03.560 --> 01:38:13.260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Which is, in this case, a lot bigger than any man-made or natural disaster that hit us.

asr-002213
01:38:13.640 --> 01:38:13.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, it's a big problem.

asr-002214
01:38:13.780 --> 01:38:18.520
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, dun po ang isang magiging relevance nung meritocracy bill.

asr-002215
01:38:18.700 --> 01:38:22.540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It will address that and incentivize good performance

asr-002216
01:38:22.540 --> 01:38:26.240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para proactively mabawasan yung sense of commission

asr-002217
01:38:26.240 --> 01:38:31.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at proactively ma-incentivize yung performance.

asr-002218
01:38:32.440 --> 01:38:36.100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, I just wanted to bring that up

asr-002219
01:38:36.100 --> 01:38:38.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and rest assured lahat po nung binanggit ninyo,

asr-002220
01:38:38.720 --> 01:38:39.560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: naka-record po yan,

asr-002221
01:38:40.200 --> 01:38:42.660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at nandito po yung ating vice chair

asr-002222
01:38:42.660 --> 01:38:47.340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at malalaman nyo rin po kung ano yung mga changes

asr-002223
01:38:47.340 --> 01:38:50.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: that we will recommend to address all those concerns.

asr-002224
01:38:51.200 --> 01:38:51.700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Salamat po.

asr-002225
01:38:51.880 --> 01:38:54.720
John Castillo: Thank you very much, Senior Vice Chair Abbott-Garcia.

asr-002226
01:38:54.720 --> 01:38:58.920
John Castillo: And to all our Vice Chair of the House Committee on Appropriations

asr-002227
01:38:58.920 --> 01:39:02.840
John Castillo: for engaging with the concerns of our CSO partners

asr-002228
01:39:02.840 --> 01:39:08.980
John Castillo: and answering their proposals raised by our civil society partners.

asr-002229
01:39:09.140 --> 01:39:11.680
John Castillo: Later on, we will discuss more about strengthening

asr-002230
01:39:11.680 --> 01:39:14.360
John Castillo: the participatory budget mechanisms,

asr-002231
01:39:14.640 --> 01:39:16.400
John Castillo: including the Philippine Budgeting Code.

asr-002232
01:39:17.040 --> 01:39:20.600
John Castillo: But for now, I think, as you all see,

asr-002233
01:39:20.720 --> 01:39:25.360
John Castillo: this exchange have been an important spirit of today's activity.

asr-002234
01:39:25.640 --> 01:39:27.660
John Castillo: Like, we listen from one another.

asr-002235
01:39:28.180 --> 01:39:30.820
John Castillo: We may come from different institutions and sectors,

asr-002236
01:39:31.280 --> 01:39:35.900
John Castillo: but meaningful budget-making requires that we listen to one another.

asr-002237
01:39:36.360 --> 01:39:40.360
John Castillo: So now, we move to the next major segment of our program.

asr-002238
01:39:40.360 --> 01:39:41.560
John Castillo: I think the launch is being...

asr-002239
01:39:41.680 --> 01:39:48.760
John Castillo: And it's already 12.13, and we're still on time for our part two of the program

asr-002240
01:39:48.760 --> 01:39:54.900
John Castillo: about CSO proposals on strengthening people's participation on the national budget.

asr-002241
01:39:55.400 --> 01:39:57.360
John Castillo: So how are we going about it?

asr-002242
01:39:57.820 --> 01:40:04.960
John Castillo: Again, if our CSO partners have their proposals, concerns, and recommendation

asr-002243
01:40:04.960 --> 01:40:09.200
John Castillo: on how to strengthen people's participation in the budget process,

asr-002244
01:40:09.200 --> 01:40:11.320
John Castillo: you may take the floor.

asr-002245
01:40:11.680 --> 01:40:13.680
John Castillo: If you have any questions, please raise your concerns.

asr-002246
01:40:13.680 --> 01:40:15.680
John Castillo: We will limit it again to two to three minutes.

asr-002247
01:40:15.680 --> 01:40:17.680
John Castillo: You can raise your hands or signify.

asr-002248
01:40:17.680 --> 01:40:23.680
John Castillo: I think I saw already Sir Tim to raise his concern.

asr-002249
01:40:23.680 --> 01:40:25.680
Tim Salomon: Yes po, salamat.

asr-002250
01:40:25.680 --> 01:40:27.680
Tim Salomon: I need to leave na rin.

asr-002251
01:40:27.680 --> 01:40:29.680
Tim Salomon: [unclear] ako na alis ako ng 12.

asr-002252
01:40:29.680 --> 01:40:34.680
Tim Salomon: But I wanted to ask for some clarifications on what transpired.

asr-002253
01:40:34.680 --> 01:40:40.680
Tim Salomon: Kasi nagkaroon po kami ng meeting with the CPBRD nung nagkaroon ng consultation

asr-002254
01:40:40.680 --> 01:40:41.680
Tim Salomon: with the CSOs.

asr-002255
01:40:41.680 --> 01:40:47.680
Tim Salomon: Tapos, we waited about one and a half months to be provided new information.

asr-002256
01:40:47.680 --> 01:40:54.680
Tim Salomon: So, within that process, we already sent questions to the DBM during the DBCC briefing,

asr-002257
01:40:54.680 --> 01:40:56.680
Tim Salomon: as well as sa DPWH.

asr-002258
01:40:56.680 --> 01:40:59.680
Tim Salomon: Tapos, we only heard their questions being read during the DILG.

asr-002259
01:40:59.680 --> 01:41:07.680
Tim Salomon: Nagpapasalamat po kami kay Chair Mika Suansing that she actually asked the questions that we issued from the CODE-NGO.

asr-002260
01:41:07.680 --> 01:41:10.680
Tim Salomon: So, I just want an explanation kung bakit ganyan yung nangyari,

asr-002261
01:41:10.680 --> 01:41:16.680
Tim Salomon: na leave out particularly these two very important agencies that we submitted for,

asr-002262
01:41:16.680 --> 01:41:18.680
Tim Salomon: yung DBM at DPWH.

asr-002263
01:41:18.680 --> 01:41:23.680
Tim Salomon: As well, the week after, kasi di ba Thursday yung DILG,

asr-002264
01:41:23.680 --> 01:41:27.680
Tim Salomon: nung OP naman, I understand nagbigay ng parliamentary courtesy.

asr-002265
01:41:27.680 --> 01:41:30.680
Tim Salomon: So, hindi nabasa yung OP questions.

asr-002266
01:41:30.680 --> 01:41:34.680
Tim Salomon: Baka pwede. I thought it would have been easy to just ask it.

asr-002267
01:41:34.680 --> 01:41:35.680
Tim Salomon: I mean, anyway.

asr-002268
01:41:35.680 --> 01:41:39.680
Tim Salomon: But also, the Department of Agriculture questions that the farmers also sent,

asr-002269
01:41:39.680 --> 01:41:41.680
Tim Salomon: weren't also asked.

asr-002270
01:41:41.680 --> 01:41:44.680
Tim Salomon: Hindi ko alam what is the reason for the inconsistencies?

asr-002271
01:41:44.680 --> 01:41:47.680
Tim Salomon: And what can we do moving forward?

asr-002272
01:41:47.680 --> 01:41:53.680
Tim Salomon: Ano ba yung, hindi ko na kasi maintindihan kung bakit hindi pwedeng maging resource persons yung CSOs.

asr-002273
01:41:53.680 --> 01:41:56.680
Tim Salomon: Nagre-research din naman kami.

asr-002274
01:41:56.680 --> 01:42:00.680
Tim Salomon: So baka pwede ninyo i-forward kasi [unclear] nakakaligtaan.

asr-002275
01:42:00.680 --> 01:42:02.680
Tim Salomon: Baka kasi ang haba na ng hearing.

asr-002276
01:42:02.680 --> 01:42:04.680
Tim Salomon: I understand seven hours na yung DA.

asr-002277
01:42:04.680 --> 01:42:08.680
Tim Salomon: So baka kung pwede naman kami magsalita naman, pwede naman sana.

asr-002278
01:42:08.680 --> 01:42:09.680
Tim Salomon: So at least yun lang po muna.

asr-002279
01:42:09.680 --> 01:42:10.680
Tim Salomon: Salamat.

asr-002280
01:42:10.680 --> 01:42:22.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Well, actually that was my agency nung first na sumagot po.

asr-002281
01:42:22.420 --> 01:42:26.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But yung sagot po ni Chair Mika Suansing,

asr-002282
01:42:26.420 --> 01:42:31.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: actually it was the first time na nabigay po sa amin yung questions n'yo.

asr-002283
01:42:31.420 --> 01:42:36.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So actually, CPBRD, I think you have to answer it

asr-002284
01:42:36.420 --> 01:42:39.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kasi hindi rin po namin alam kung anong nangyari

asr-002285
01:42:39.420 --> 01:42:42.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kasi dapat po pinasa po sa amin

asr-002286
01:42:42.420 --> 01:42:44.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: with every agency.

asr-002287
01:42:44.420 --> 01:42:47.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So nung nakita po namin yun,

asr-002288
01:42:47.420 --> 01:42:50.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nalaman po namin

asr-002289
01:42:50.420 --> 01:42:54.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kaya po nag-explain kaagad si Chair Mika Suansing na

asr-002290
01:42:54.420 --> 01:42:59.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nagulat din po ako na first time na nabasa yung inyong katanungan.

asr-002291
01:42:59.420 --> 01:43:01.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So we apologize for that.

asr-002292
01:43:01.420 --> 01:43:04.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But on the part of the Appro Committee,

asr-002293
01:43:04.420 --> 01:43:09.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: wala po kaming natanggap na mga tanong galing po sa inyo.

asr-002294
01:43:09.420 --> 01:43:11.420
John Castillo: Okay, thank you, Kong Arne, for that input.

asr-002295
01:43:11.420 --> 01:43:17.420
John Castillo: May we call on the members of anyone available from the task force

asr-002296
01:43:17.420 --> 01:43:19.420
John Castillo: on people's participation?

asr-002297
01:43:19.420 --> 01:43:24.420
John Castillo: Because as I made aware, one of the things that needs to happen first

asr-002298
01:43:24.420 --> 01:43:28.420
John Castillo: is to the guidelines and the task force.

asr-002299
01:43:28.420 --> 01:43:30.420
John Castillo: But I'm really not sure.

asr-002300
01:43:30.420 --> 01:43:37.420
John Castillo: So if we can hear from anyone from the task force on this matter or issue.

asr-002301
01:43:37.420 --> 01:43:44.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The question is...

asr-002302
01:43:44.090 --> 01:43:45.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: For us, kasi it's...

asr-002303
01:43:46.090 --> 01:43:47.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's...

asr-002304
01:43:47.090 --> 01:43:48.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's...

asr-002305
01:43:48.090 --> 01:43:49.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hindi na kailangang tanungin 'yun eh.

asr-002306
01:43:49.090 --> 01:43:51.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I mean, if you have questions, we read it.

asr-002307
01:43:51.090 --> 01:43:54.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So let the Secretary answer it.

asr-002308
01:43:54.090 --> 01:43:58.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But I'll answer lang as the resource person.

asr-002309
01:43:58.090 --> 01:43:59.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I think we have to study it.

asr-002310
01:43:59.090 --> 01:44:02.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kasi sa rules po namin talaga,

asr-002311
01:44:02.090 --> 01:44:06.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: usually, ginigrill po namin,

asr-002312
01:44:06.090 --> 01:44:10.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: tinatanong namin is yung mga nasa agency, nagtatrabaho po sa gobyerno.

asr-002313
01:44:10.090 --> 01:44:14.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But nevertheless, yung ginagawa po natin ngayon na nagtatanong po kayo

asr-002314
01:44:14.090 --> 01:44:17.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: at sinasagot naman po nila,

asr-002315
01:44:17.090 --> 01:44:19.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: binabasa po namin,

asr-002316
01:44:19.090 --> 01:44:21.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: is nakakapag-participate po kayo.

asr-002317
01:44:21.090 --> 01:44:24.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I don't think lang nasa rules po ng Congress

asr-002318
01:44:24.090 --> 01:44:27.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na puwede po kayo maging resource person

asr-002319
01:44:27.090 --> 01:44:33.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dahil ang resource person po talaga during the budget season,

asr-002320
01:44:33.090 --> 01:44:37.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung po talaga ang agency na nagde-defend ng budget po nila.

asr-002321
01:44:37.090 --> 01:44:40.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And even agency na humihingi,

asr-002322
01:44:40.090 --> 01:44:42.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: we call it, hirit,

asr-002323
01:44:42.090 --> 01:44:46.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na baka po hindi po napag-aralan talaga ng DBM

asr-002324
01:44:46.090 --> 01:44:51.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: sa dami po ng fiscal space is masyadong masikip.

asr-002325
01:44:51.090 --> 01:44:55.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So ganoon po yung mga nangyayari.

asr-002326
01:44:55.090 --> 01:44:58.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, but any questions naman po na galing sa inyo,

asr-002327
01:44:58.090 --> 01:45:00.090
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: we are very much willing to read it.

asr-002328
01:45:00.140 --> 01:45:02.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and let them answer

asr-002329
01:45:02.060 --> 01:45:02.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: para maging

asr-002330
01:45:02.980 --> 01:45:05.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: maklaro po sa atin yung mga issues

asr-002331
01:45:05.960 --> 01:45:08.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ng bawat agency sa ating

asr-002332
01:45:08.020 --> 01:45:09.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pong gobyerno.

asr-002333
01:45:15.810 --> 01:45:18.930
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Number one, kaya nga sasabi ko

asr-002334
01:45:18.930 --> 01:45:20.830
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dapat ang sumagot

asr-002335
01:45:20.830 --> 01:45:21.270
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang

asr-002336
01:45:21.270 --> 01:45:23.970
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: CPBRD

asr-002337
01:45:23.970 --> 01:45:26.710
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: but hindi po nakarating po sa amin.

asr-002338
01:45:27.730 --> 01:45:29.030
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, kindly answer it.

asr-002339
01:45:29.030 --> 01:45:32.870
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, sir. We will wait for

asr-002340
01:45:32.870 --> 01:45:34.130
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: their response.

asr-002341
01:45:36.930 --> 01:45:38.450
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Miscommunication,

asr-002342
01:45:39.010 --> 01:45:40.170
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: misunderstand, ano ba yan?

asr-002343
01:45:40.350 --> 01:45:41.190
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hindi ko maintindihan eh.

